# L §5.19 gap, a balance read (tally 2.1.7 R6, issue #145; G8): a plan whose amount reads gap(konto, d) reaches
# a running read of konto, refused at load (LOAD-READS, E §4.1: plans never read a running balance). 2.1.6's
# refcore read a half-built walk: HOLE-NOREADING.
=== m.tally
model g8
  tally 2
  on 2025-01-01
  start 2025-01-01
  end 2025-03-31
unit DUK: currency minor 0.01
source s "s"
place konto: accounts DUK lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 2025-01-01..
move fee[m in months]: transfers
  on end_of(m)
  leg cash from world to konto amount gap(konto, start_of(m))
version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-01-01
  anchor konto
  stated[konto] = 5.00 DUK at 2025-01-01 end "s"
ask q: bal(konto, 2025-03-31)
=== expect
refused: LOAD-READS fee reaches a running read or projection of konto without reads konto ...
